    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"2922\" data-end=\"2936\"><em data-start=\"2922\" data-end=\"2936\">(18th Level)</em></p><p data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2978\">You force metaphor into literal reality.</p><p data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"2993\">Once per arc:</p><p data-start=\"2995\" data-end=\"3014\">Declare a metaphor.</p><p data-start=\"3016\" data-end=\"3058\">For the scene, it becomes physically true.</p><p data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3069\">Examples:</p><ul data-start=\"3070\" data-end=\"3287\"><li data-start=\"3070\" data-end=\"3126\"><p data-start=\"3072\" data-end=\"3126\">“He is a storm.” → Environmental upheaval follows him.</p></li><li data-start=\"3127\" data-end=\"3175\"><p data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3175\">“This place is a cage.” → Exits resist escape.</p></li><li data-start=\"3176\" data-end=\"3227\"><p data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3227\">“They are wolves.” → Pack coordination manifests.</p></li><li data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3287\"><p data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3287\">“This city is a wound.” → Bleeding consequences escalate.</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3297\">Cost</h3><p data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3318\">Catastrophic Strain.</p><p data-start=\"3320\" data-end=\"3343\">Backlash is guaranteed.</p><p data-start=\"3345\" data-end=\"3382\">Reality will respond after the scene.</p><p data-start=\"3384\" data-end=\"3416\">You cannot Make It True quietly.</p><p data-start=\"3418\" data-end=\"3441\">The universe remembers.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
